<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Quinn announces changes to employers' PRSI.</title>
<headline>Quinn announces changes to employers' PRSI.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish finance minister Ruairi Quinn said he was increasing the threshold below which employers' pay-related social insurance applied to 13,500 punts per annum from 13,000 punts.</p>
</text>
